+### 7.1 PYUSD withdrawal while the user has a loan (after borrowing is enabled)
+
+PYUSD has no price on the controller. A withdrawal by an account that has **any** outstanding borrow on any market needs a price for the withdrawn token, so a PYUSD withdrawal fails in simulation with `Price unavailable` until every borrow is repaid. Accounts with no debt are unaffected.
+
+- Before building the transaction, if `get_account_snapshot(user)` on any borrowable market shows debt > 0, disable PYUSD withdraw and show: *"Repay your loans first. PYUSD has no price on Peridot, so it can't be withdrawn while you have an open borrow."*
+- Map the simulation error `Price unavailable` on the PYUSD market to the same message.
+- On the deposit screen for PYUSD, when the user has debt, warn before deposit: *"While you have an open borrow, you won't be able to withdraw this PYUSD until you repay."*
