 ## 8. Submitting transactions
 
 - **Inclusion fee.** Do not hard-code the 100-stroop minimum. On 12 November a transaction bidding 100 stroops was accepted for submission and then never included, because Soroban transactions were clearing at 200. Call RPC `getFeeStats`, take `sorobanInclusionFee.p99`, and bid a multiple of it (we use 5×, with a floor of 1,000 stroops and a ceiling of 100,000). Use `p99`, not `max`: a single outlier bid of about 1 XLM appeared in `max` the same day.
